{title: Sing We Now of Christmas}
{key: Am}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Am]Sing we [D]now of [Am]Christ[**]mas; [D]Noel, [F]sing we [Am]here[**]
[Am]Hear our [D]grateful [Am]praises[**] [D]to the [F]babe so [Am]dear[**]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]Sing [**]we No[E7]el[**], the [Am]King is [**]born, No[E7]el[**]!
[Am]Sing we [D]now of [Am]Christ[**]mas, [D]sing we [F]now, No[Am]el![**]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Am]Angels [D]called to [Am]shep[**]herds, "[D]Leave your [F]flocks at [Am]rest[**]
[Am]Journey [D]forth to [Am]Bethle[**]hem, [D]find the [F]lambkin [Am]blest[**]."
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
In [Am]Bethle[D]hem they [Am]found [**]him; [D]Joseph and [F]Mary [Am]mild[**]
[Am]Seated [D]by the [Am]man[**]ger, [D]watching the [F]holy [Am]child[**].
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Am]From the [D]eastern [Am]coun[**]try [D]came the [F]kings a[Am]far[**]
[Am]Bearing [D]gifts to [Am]Bethle[**]hem [D]guided [F]by a [Am]star[**].
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[Am]Gold and [D]myrrh they [Am]took [**]there, [D]gifts of [F]greatest [Am]price[**]
[Am]There was [D]ne'er a [Am]place on [**]earth [D]so like [F]para[Am]dise[**].
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
